The  driver  provides  a line discipline to send and receive IrDA
frames over a serial line via an  IrDA  dongle.   Access  to  the
frames  is  via  the driver.  Different dongles require different
handling.  The connected dongle type can be set with  calls:  Set
the dongle type.  See the include file for possible dongles.  Get
the  dongle type.  Get the number of the device that must be used
